name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q15_2025'

question ' A developer uses an AI to generate a loop. The AI\'s code works but is very complex and difficult to explain. What is the most accountable action for the developer?'

wrong 'Use the code anyway because it works.'
wrong 'Delete the code and write it from scratch without any AI help.'
right 'Refactor (simplify) and document the code until they fully understand how it works and can verify its safety.'
wrong 'Ask a different AI to explain why the first AI wrote it that way.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 11

AI accountability means the human developer is responsible for the code. Using code you don't understand is a risk; you must be able to verify and explain your logic.
MARKDOWN
